ce ${a}_{n},$ given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}={a}_{n}-5,\\,{a}_{1}=0,\\,n\\in N.\n$$\n\nLet's write down the first few terms of our sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =0 \\\\ {a}_{2} & ={a}_{1}-5 \\\\  & =0-5 \\\\  & =-5 \\\\ {a}_{3} & ={a}_{2}-5 \\\\  & =-5-5 \\\\  & =-10 \\\\ {a}_{4} & ={a}_{3}-5 \\\\  & =-10-5 \\\\  & =-15 \\\\ {a}_{5} & ={a}_{4}-5 \\\\  & =-15-5 \\\\  & =-20 \\\\  & ⋮\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nA={0,-5,-10,-15,-20,…}.\n$$" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348727 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348728 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348729 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348730 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348731 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1041 "selection" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348731 13194139535430 true] [17592186348726 1110 #uuid "d9621992-ee48-56d0-a881-5dc9e1ddb1f9" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348727 1034 "{0,-5,-10,-25,-30,…}" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348727 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535430 true] [17592186348727 1111 #uuid "6eeb1f1c-8e48-5fb0-bfef-4bef8834736e" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348728 1034 "{0,-5,-10,-15,-45,…}" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348728 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535430 true] [17592186348728 1111 #uuid "9ff35a78-edf9-5f61-b6e4-0cd99eea48d1" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348729 1034 "{0,-5,-10,-25,-50,…}" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348729 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535430 true] [17592186348729 1111 #uuid "a10c3a1c-2d6a-5b27-9166-20680fde012e" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348730 1034 "{0,-5,-10,-20,-30,…}" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348730 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535430 true] [17592186348730 1111 #uuid "77cb21a7-c7ea-5242-a783-6ff641f2eddb" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348731 1034 "{0,-5,-10,-15,-20,…}" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348731 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535430 true] [17592186348731 1111 #uuid "b7799269-2fa2-5041-8be1-ce42bbacbe87" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348732 1017 #edb/ref 17592186348733 13194139535430 true] [17592186348732 1089 "q-181710" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348732 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535430 true] [17592186348732 1100 "Consider the set $B,$ defined as\n\n$$\nB={{b}_{n}\\,:\\,{b}_{n+2}={b}_{n+1}+{b}_{n}\\,,\\,{b}_{1}=0,\\,{b}_{2}=3,\\,n\\in N}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following sets is equivalent to $B?$" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348732 1113 #uuid "063c6e59-91ab-5b23-8d93-b847593363af" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348732 1145 "The elements of $B$ are all the terms of the *recursive* sequence ${b}_{n},$ given by\n\n$$\n{b}_{n+2}={b}_{n+1}+{b}_{n},\\,{b}_{1}=0,\\,{b}_{2}=3,\\,n\\in N.\n$$\n\nNotice that this is a Fibonacci sequence with ${b}_{1}=0$ and ${b}_{2}=3.$\n\nLet's write down the first few terms of our sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{1} & =0 \\\\ {b}_{2} & =3 \\\\ {b}_{3} & ={b}_{2}+{b}_{1} \\\\  & =3+0 \\\\  & =3 \\\\ {b}_{4} & ={b}_{3}+{b}_{2} \\\\  & =3+3 \\\\  & =6 \\\\ {b}_{5} & ={b}_{4}+{b}_{3} \\\\  & =6+3 \\\\  & =9 \\\\ {b}_{6} & ={b}_{5}+{b}_{4} \\\\  & =9+6 \\\\  & =15 \\\\  & ⋮\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nB={0,3,3,6,9,15,…}={0,3,6,9,15,…}.\n$$" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348734 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348735 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348736 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348737 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348738 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1041 "selection" 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348737 13194139535430 true] [17592186348733 1110 #uuid "37ea51b8-6d68-57fc-997b-0322aac04e3a" 13194139535430 true] [175921863